# SCSS tokens

Token partials live in `src/styles/`:

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `_colors.scss` | surfaces, text, accent |
| `_typography.scss` | font-family, font-size, letter-spacing, line-height |
| `_spacing.scss` | margins, paddings, gaps |
| `_sizes.scss` | widths, heights, borders, radii, media geometry |

## `@use` order in component/page SCSS

1. `sass:*` built-ins (only if needed)
2. `colors`
3. `typography`
4. `spacing`
5. `sizes`

Omit unused modules. Prefer `as *` to match the project.

```scss
@use "../../styles/colors" as *;
@use "../../styles/typography" as *;
@use "../../styles/spacing" as *;
@use "../../styles/sizes" as *;
```
